      "title_en": "Projecting potential population exposure to the invasive malaria vector Anopheles stephensi",
      "title_zh": "对入侵性疟疾媒介——斯蒂芬氏按蚊（Anopheles stephensi）可能造成的人口暴露情况进行预测",
      "link": "https://iopscience.iop.org/article/10.1088/1748-9326/aeb558",
